  "content": "\n\n<p>伺服器上的所有玩家都必須下載此模組</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_98066fa1-c16c-4be0-82e0-d8fb321fdbcd.png\"></p>\n<p>您需要巨型木棍來合成此模組中的所有工具。</p>\n<p>合成配方來自原版 Minecraft（僅以鎬子為例）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9e35700-6b52-4587-82f0-139056aab986.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_11485deb-2475-4e9b-9e78-e3cc1bc39e02.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2514ceb3-82d5-4a4e-b21b-ccfb1e96a6f3.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_59735080-9858-4630-89b9-93e7a6af29eb.png\"></p>",
